      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;#39;s have a look at the why and how of virtualization and see how it impacts applications with a big hunger for resources. We will run through the different layers of a virtualized environment and examine their impact. Can we tune MySQL to be better adapted to a virtual environment?&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
